# WebSocket HTTPS patch

This patch is intentionally kept as a reference because AvNav's WebSocket
client location can differ between releases.

If a release contains a hard-coded browser URL like:

    ws://$HOST:<port>/...

change only the scheme to:

    wss://$HOST:<port>/...

When AvNav is served through the same HTTPS origin, prefer a relative URL
(/ws) or derive the scheme from window.location.protocol. Traefik forwards
WebSocket Upgrade headers automatically; no separate WebSocket router is
required.

Do not apply this file blindly. Confirm the exact source line in the selected
AvNav release first.
